# Python Test Environment

Always activate the `fullstack-template` pyenv virtual environment before running any Python tooling or tests in this repo, and install dependencies when needed.

If a test run fails due to a missing module, install it into the active env (prefer installing from the project config when possible).

## Examples

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
pyenv activate fullstack-template
cd apps/api
pip install -e .
pytest
```

```bash
# ❌ BAD
cd apps/api
pytest
```
